OL,3,CBritish man arrested in Cyprus accused
OL,4,Cof 'hostile surveillance' for Iran's
OL,5,CIRGC
OL,7,FA British man has been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of conducting hostile
OL,9,Fsurveillance at an RAF base in Cyprus
OL,10,Fand sharing information with Iran's
OL,11,FIslamic Revolutionary Guards Corps
OL,12,F(IRGC), police said.
OL,14,FRashad Sultanov, 44, a dual UK and
OL,15,FAzerbaijani national, was arrested on
OL,16,F17 July by Cypriot authorities and is
OL,17,Fbeing held in custody as extradition
OL,18,Fproceedings progress, the Metropolitan
OL,19,FPolice said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
