PN,31902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785530891
OL,3,CBritish man arrested in Cyprus accused
OL,4,Cof 'hostile surveillance' for Iran's
OL,5,CIRGC
OL,7,FThe force said the Crown Prosecution
OL,8,FService (CPS) has authorised charges
OL,9,Fagainst him under the National
OL,10,FSecurity Act.
OL,12,FThe arrest of Sultanov, of Islington,
OL,13,Fnorth London, was part of the first
OL,14,Finvestigation using the National
OL,15,FSecurity Act in relation to alleged
OL,16,Foffences in an overseas territory, the
OL,17,Fforce added.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
