PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1785530891
OL,3,CBritish man arrested in Cyprus accused
OL,4,Cof 'hostile surveillance' for Iran's
OL,5,CIRGC
OL,7,FIt follows an investigation led by
OL,8,FCounter Terrorism Policing (CTP)
OL,9,FLondon, into incidents at RAF Akrotiri
OL,10,Fbetween May 11 and June 22 last year.
OL,12,FCommander Helen Flanagan, head of CTP
OL,13,FLondon, said: "This case shows we are
OL,14,Fable to use the National Security Act
OL,15,Foverseas when British military bases
OL,16,Fare allegedly targeted by hostile
OL,17,Fstate activity.
OL,19,F"A huge amount of partnership work has
OL,20,Fbeen carried out between British and
OL,21,FCypriot law enforcement agencies.
